    "name": "Red D'Anjou Pears",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The flavor of this pear is sweet with just a taste of citrus. The best indication of ripeness for any pear is the thumb test: gentle thumb pressure near the stem will yield slightly when the pear is ripe. Red Anjous, like all pears, ripen when held at room temperature. Depending on their level of ripeness when purchased, it may take several days before they are ready to eat.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grown by Mt Hood Organic Farms located in Parkdale OR</span></p>",
